  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Procurement of Services for Project Support to Democratic Development is a component of Project Support to Democratic Development (PSDD) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;168,463. It works in the following sector(s): Decentralisation and support to subnational government, Road transport, Agricultural development, Health education, Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Forestry development, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Fishery development.</narrative>
